The demo was probably opened via a local server, or opened via file:// in Firefox (which allows file module scripts? Firefox also restricts it…). Safest: serve the repo directory over a small http server (node's `http` + `fs`) on 127.0.0.1:8123, and point Chrome at `http://127.0.0.1:8123/demo.html`.

